      "content": "The response you gave seems a bit tilted towards the inclusivity side. When you say the positive impact \"can outweigh\" the negatives, it sounds like you're leaning towards it being the right move. Could you give me a more detailed breakdown of the arguments from people who think this is actually harmful to the workplace? Like, what are the specific criticisms regarding how it affects communication or how it's perceived by certain groups?",
